# BOOMTOWN: a whole run is playable and can be won. The demo player presses
# real buttons each frame: it tries every firework on offer on every free
# tile and facing, keeps the one whose best chain leaves the town safest (and
# reaches nearest the bogles still standing), and lights the best fuse once
# the night is safe. Ten nights and the Bog King, with no help.
seed 5
game boomtown
wait 20
botuntil state == 3 400
expect round == 1
botuntil round == 5 60000
botuntil state == 9 200000
expect result == 3
expect king_hp == 0
expect goals & 1
expect goals & 2
expect wins == 1
expect score >= 10000
